{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iJdeRpISve1792685931.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>甲一籃球聯賽，滿貫贏晉裕7分。</p><p></p><p>綠衫的滿貫，蔡再懃有20分，他們五位正選得分雙位數，晉裕有三人，安家仲攻入16分，包括四球三分。</p><p></p><p>首節領先3分，滿貫半場反先6分，退役大半年的泰那，復出上演「地標戰」，取得13分，科華斯10分10籃板，惠龍兒就有，並列球隊最高20分12籃板。</p><p></p><p>全場最高分是晉裕的麥洛連，交出21分12籃板，第三節打出21-11比分，滿貫完這節落後4分。不過最後一節以29-18還以顏色，最後贏90-83。這支上季常規賽冠軍，開季三勝一負。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:40:38.730338+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:18:00.904064+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:38:09.651554+00:00","content_hash":"fee64b9ddaf105522fead74d792abac7f57fccca6e1bad7fdd9542334b52ec00","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}